  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "渲染侧要点",
      "items": [
        "getItemCount / getItemViewType / onCreateViewHolder 都是 final，空状态和内容共享同一个 Adapter",
        "runAnimator 只在 holder.layoutPosition 超过水位线时执行，滚动复用不会重复播放"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "加载侧要点",
      "items": [
        "QuickAdapterHelper 用 ConcatAdapter 把内容、首尾 LoadStateAdapter 拼成一个 adapter 挂到列表",
        "preloadSize 为 0 时在 footer 附着时触发，否则由 checkPreload 按距尾部条数提前加载"
      ]
    }
  ]
